              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha left Jericho to go to Bethel, and on the way some boys came out of a town and made fun of him. “Get out of here, baldy!” they shouted.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.23",
